{
  "name": "Create a dosya.dev folder for each new client",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create a client folder\n\nCustomer data posted to the webhook creates a folder named after the customer, e.g. `Acme Ltd (C-1042)`, inside the folder you choose. Posting the same customer again reuses the folder.\n\n**Setup**\n1. **Create Client Folder**: choose your dosya.dev API credential, a **Workspace**, and a **Parent Folder** such as \"Clients\".\n2. Activate, then test with:\n```\ncurl -X POST -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"customer_id\":\"C-1042\",\"name\":\"Acme Ltd\"}' \\\n  https://YOUR-N8N/webhook/dosya-client-folder\n```\n\n**Replace Slashes With Dashes** is on, so a name like \"A/B Trading\" stays one folder.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "c3f2e5d4-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup c3f2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dosya-client-folder",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f2e5d4-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000002",
      "name": "New Client",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        80
      ],
      "webhookId": "c3f2e5d4-0003-4e3a-9c30-0000000000aa"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "folder",
        "operation": "create",
        "workspace": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "folder": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "name": "={{ $json.body.customer_id ? $json.body.name + ' (' + $json.body.customer_id + ')' : $json.body.name }}",
        "options": {
          "slashesInName": true
        }
      },
      "id": "c3f2e5d4-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000003",
      "name": "Create Client Folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-dosya.dosya",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { folder_id: $json.id, folder_name: $json.name, created: $json.created } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f2e5d4-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000004",
      "name": "Respond with Folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        80
      ]
    }
  ],
